OL,3,AEU and Nato vow to step up pressure on
OL,4,ARussia after 'new escalation' in
OL,5,AGermany
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe heads of Nato and the European
OL,8,FCommission have warned that Russia is
OL,9,Fgrowing increasingly reckless and vowed
OL,10,Fto respond to a "new normal".
OL,12,F"Leipzig marks a new escalation on
OL,13,FEuropean Union soil directly attributed
OL,14,Fto Russia," said Commission President
OL,15,FUrsula von der Leyen, a day after
OL,16,FGermany blamed Russia for a failed
OL,17,Fdrone attack last month on Leipzig
OL,18,Fairport.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
